      "message": "This is still a pretty big change, and it\u0027s hard to verify functionality isn\u0027t lost.\n\nCan you split this up further.  If you set the Cq-Depend to the last CL in the chain, then the commit queue will submit the changes together and the individual CLs don\u0027t have to compile.\n\nSuggested CLs. \n1. Move routines the flash protection routines flash_get_status1() through flash_write_prot_reg() from shim/flash.c to cros_flash/cros_flash_npcx.c.\n2. NPCX specific code from flash_dev_init(), crec_flash_physical_write() and crec_flash_physical_erase()\n3. Move NPCX specific code from crec_flash_physical_get_protect(), crec_flash_physical_get_protect_flags(), crec_flash_physical_protect_at_boot(), and crec_flash_physical_protect_now()\n\n\n",
